ng:Bill_Nighy_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Golden Globe Award" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Bill Nighy" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "2007-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "William Francis Nighy (; born 12 December 1949) is a British actor. Known for his work on stage and screen, he has received various accolades including two BAFTA Awards and a Golden Globe Award, in addition to nominations for an Academy Award, a Tony Award, a Laurence Olivier Award and two Screen Actors Guild Awards. Nighy started his career with the Everyman Theatre, Liverpool, and made his London debut with the Royal National Theatre starting with The Illuminatus! in 1977." .

ng:Bill_Peet_award_received_Disney_Legends a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Disney Legends" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Bill Peet" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1996-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "William Bartlett Peet (né Peed; January 29, 1915&#160;– May 11, 2002) was an American children's book illustrator and a story writer and animator for Walt Disney Animation Studios. Peet joined Disney in 1937 and worked first on Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937) near the end of its production. Progressively, his involvement in the Disney studio's animated feature films and shorts increased, and he remained there until early in the development of The Jungle Book (1967)." .

ng:Bill_Tytla_award_received_Disney_Legends a sem:Event ;
