    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Bob Broughton" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "2001-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Robert Carey Broughton (September 17, 1917 – January 19, 2009) was an American film camera operator known for his work with Walt Disney Pictures, where he was responsible for several innovations in visual effects technology." .

