    rdfs:comment "Bob Moore may refer to: Bob Moore (musician) (1932–2021), American session musician Bob Moore (executive) (1929–2024), co-founder of Bob's Red Mill Bob Moore (American football) (born 1949), American football tight end Bob Moore (Australian footballer) (1872–1938), Australian footballer for Melbourne Bob Moore (Irish footballer), 1887 Irish international footballer Bob Moore (gambler) (c." .

