ng:Brad_Dourif_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Golden Globe Award" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Brad Dourif" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1950-03-18"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Bradford Claude Dourif (; born March 18, 1950) is an American actor. He is known for his Academy Award-nominated role as Billy Bibbit in One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest (1975), portraying Gríma Wormtongue in The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers (2002), and voicing Chucky in the Child's Play franchise (1988–present). Brad Dourif's other film credits include Wise Blood (1979), Heaven's Gate (1980), Ragtime (1981), Dune (1984), Blue Velvet (1986), Mississippi Burning (1988), The Exorcist III (1990), Alien Resurrection (1997), Halloween (2007) and its 2009 sequel." .

ng:Brad_Pitt_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Golden Globe Award" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:relatesTo ng:MTV_Movie_Award_for_Best_Male_Performance_winner_Brad_Pitt ;
    ng:subject "Brad Pitt" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1996-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "William Bradley Pitt (born December 18, 1963) is an American actor and film producer. In a film career spanning more than thirty years, Pitt has received numerous accolades, including two Academy Awards, two British Academy Film Awards, two Golden Globe Awards, two Primetime Emmy Awards, and one Volpi Cup. His films as a leading actor have grossed over $7.5&#160;billion worldwide." .

