ng:Carrie_Fisher_award_received_Disney_Legends a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Disney Legends" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Carrie Fisher" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "2017-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Carrie Frances Fisher (October 21, 1956 – December 27, 2016) was an American actress and writer. She is best known for playing Princess Leia in the original Star Wars films (1977–1983) and reprised the role in The Force Awakens (2015), The Last Jedi (2017)—a posthumous release that was dedicated to her—and The Rise of Skywalker (2019), the latter using unreleased footage from The Force Awakens. Her other film credits include Shampoo (1975), The Blues Brothers (1980), Hannah and Her Sisters (1986), The 'Burbs (1989), When Harry Met Sally... (1989), Soapdish (1991), and The Women (2008)." .

