ng:Jennifer_Lawrence_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Golden Globe Award" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Jennifer Lawrence" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1990-08-15"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Jennifer Shrader Maroney (née&#160;Lawrence, born August 15, 1990) is an American actress and producer. She has starred in both action film franchises and independent dramas, and her films have grossed over $6&#160;billion worldwide. She was the world's highest-paid actress in 2015 and 2016." .

