    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Jodie Foster" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1991-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Alicia Christian \"Jodie\" Foster (born November 19, 1962) is an American actress and filmmaker. Foster started her career as a child actor before establishing herself as a leading actress in film. As a performer, she is known for her versatility." .

