ng:Philip_Seymour_Hoffman_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Golden Globe Award" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Philip Seymour Hoffman" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1967-07-23"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Philip Seymour Hoffman (July 23, 1967 – February 2, 2014) was an American actor. He was known for his distinctive supporting character roles and his memorable leading roles in many films and theatrical productions from the early 1990s until his death in 2014. He was voted the greatest actor of the 21st century in a 2024 ranking by The Independent." .

ng:Pinto_Colvig_award_received_Disney_Legends a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Disney Legends" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Pinto Colvig" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "1993-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Vance DeBar Colvig Sr. (September 11, 1892 – October 3, 1967), known professionally as Pinto Colvig, was an American actor, animator, cartoonist, and circus and vaudeville performer. He was best known for being the original performer of the Disney characters Goofy and Pluto, as well as Bozo the Clown and Bluto in Popeye. In 1993, he was posthumously made a Disney Legend for his contributions to Walt Disney Films, including Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs and Fun and Fancy Free." .

ng:Rachel_Brosnahan_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "Golden Globe Award" ;
    ng:property "award received" ;
    ng:subject "Rachel Brosnahan" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "2017-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Rachel Elizabeth Brosnahan (born July 12, 1990) is an American actress. She rose to fame for her performance as Midge Maisel in the Amazon Prime Video period comedy series The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel (2017–2023), for which she won a Primetime Emmy Award in 2018 and two consecutive Golden Globe Awards in 2018 and 2019." .

ng:Rachel_Carson_award_received_Golden_Globe_Award a sem:Event ;
