ng:Channing_Tatum_nominated_for_MTV_Movie_Award_for_Best_Male_Performance a sem:Event ;
    ng:object "MTV Movie Award for Best Male Performance" ;
    ng:property "nominated for" ;
    ng:subject "Channing Tatum" ;
    sem:hasTimeStamp "2013-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Channing Matthew Tatum (born April 26, 1980) is an American actor and film producer. He made his film debut in the drama Coach Carter (2005), and had his breakthrough with the sports comedy film She's the Man (2006) and the dance film Step Up (2006). He rose to prominence for playing Duke in the action films G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra (2009) and G.I. Joe: Retaliation (2013), the title role in the comedy-drama films Magic Mike (2012), Magic Mike XXL (2015) and Magic Mike's Last Dance (2023), and an undercover cop in the action-comedy films 21 Jump Street (2012)" .

