    sem:hasTimeStamp "2010-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Robert Douglas Thomas Pattinson (born 13 May 1986) is an English actor and film producer. He is known for starring in both major studio productions and independent films, in which he often portrays eccentric characters across a diverse range of genres. Pattinson has been ranked among the world's highest-paid actors and his works have grossed over $4.7&#160;billion worldwide." .

